                :query-script "com-junkawasaki/root scripts/compliance-fact-query.cljs (nbb, npm datascript) -- corrects the original 'place in kotoba-lang' plan to match the existing scripts/labor-liberation-sd.cljs + manifest/edn-query.cljs convention"
