                :isic-alignment "ISIC 6419 (banking) -- one of the 12 cloud-itonami-isic-8291-linked verticals per the owner's 'align to already-implemented ISIC' decision; same jurisdiction (JPN) as tick-1's country-level statute.facts, so cross-source queries are meaningful"
